  vendorName: Importer Sterling
  offerText: I have a massive oak barrel of imported wine that requires temporary
    housing. Clear your floor for it, and you may sample a glass for your troubles.
  acceptResultText: The heavy barrel dominates the room. You pour yourself a glass,
    enjoying the rich, sophisticated taste.
  rejectResultText: You refuse the giant barrel, thoroughly enjoying the ability
    to actually walk across your room without tripping.
  acceptedDelayedText: The wine was incredibly acidic and burns your stomach terribly.
    To make matters worse, Sterling sends you an aggressive invoice for the 'sample'
    you drank!
